細麵部份是有些粗度的捲麵，不僅有Q度，又有道地日本拉麵的硬嚼勁，且麵條與湯頭搭配得很好，也是很優秀；叉燒則是比較平實的胡椒調味厚片，是比較偏火腿的口感，中規中矩；份量部份，本店不虧是二郎系，相當於中碗的小雞加上一份高麗菜就可以吃到很飽接近撐的程度。整體來說這是一間湯頭、麵條和份量都十分讓人滿意的店，會想再次造訪。",null,[0,225]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3826190986246384174/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhXTkU1VVRuSk5NamwwWWxab1dsUXdPRFJVUjFKeFRXeGFWVll5WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3826190986246384174/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhXTkU1VVRuSk5NamwwWWxab1dsUXdPRFJVUjFKeFRXeGFWVll5WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/3826190986246384174/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhXTkU1VVRuSk5NamwwWWxab1dsUXdPRFJVUjFKeFRXeGFWVll5WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3826190986246384174/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhXTkU1VVRuSk5NamwwWWxab1dsUXdPRFJVUjFKeFRXeGFWVll5WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3826190986246384174/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhXTkU1VVRuSk5NamwwWWxab1dsUXdPRFJVUjFKeFRXeGFWVll5WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3826190986246384174/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhXTkU1VVRuSk5NamwwWWxab1dsUXdPRFJVUjFKeFRXeGFWVll5WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,8023,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWNE5UTnJNMjl0YlZoWlQwODRUR1JxTWxaVVYyYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x72fba6fab63a247e!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlV4NTNrM29tbVhZT084TGRqMlZUV2c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWNE5UTnJNMjl0YlZoWlQwODRUR1JxTWxaVVYyYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWNE5UTnJNMjl0YlZoWlQwODRUR1JxTWxaVVYyYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWNE5UTnJNMjl0YlZoWlQwODRUR1JxTWxaVVYyYxILMGU0SXNPRGhkUXoaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09sVjROVE5yTTI5dGJWaFpUMDg0VEdScU1sWlVWMmMSCzBlNEl