參考～\n1.如果肉片本身直徑面積小就是會厚一點。\n2.如果肉片本身直徑面積大就是會薄一點。\n重量重來沒有改變過\n一向都是特別交代切肉師傅\n要以優於客人的重量方式去切\n我做事從來不偷工，更不要說為了多賺一些去刻意將肉切薄，這意義在哪？？拉麵又不是一個輕鬆的工作，如果不能賣我就選擇停業，不會在這種地方下心思，這不是我的個性！\n跟我做過事的人都知道，我有一點潔癖，做事很龜毛(包括道德潔癖，世上不是每個人都一定將心思放在貪錢財上面)，龜毛到連我自己都有點覺得自己很煩，所以盡量不要質疑我，我會難過的！\n以上給大家說明一下，感謝！\n店主敬上",null,[0,69]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3826190986246384174/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvV0dJemNGSlJiVkpKVmxWNFIxSnJWa2hrUlUweFRucEdXRlJ1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3826190986246384174/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvV0dJemNGSlJiVkpKVmxWNFIxSnJWa2hrUlUweFRucEdXRlJ1WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/3826190986246384174/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvV0dJemNGSlJiVkpKVmxWNFIxSnJWa2hrUlUweFRucEdXRlJ1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3826190986246384174/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvV0dJemNGSlJiVkpKVmxWNFIxSnJWa2hrUlUweFRucEdXRlJ1WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3826190986246384174/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvV0dJemNGSlJiVkpKVmxWNFIxSnJWa2hrUlUweFRucEdXRlJ1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3826190986246384174/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvV0dJemNGSlJiVkpKVmxWNFIxSnJWa2hrUlUweFRucEdXRlJ1WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,4933,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poWGIzcFJRbVJJVlV4R1JrVkhkRU0xTnpGWFRuYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x72fba6fab63a247e!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjhXb3pRQmRIVUxGRkVHdEM1NzFXTnc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poWGIzcFJRbVJJVlV4R1JrVkhkRU0xTnpGWFRuYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poWGIzcFJRbVJJVlV4R1JrVkhkRU0xTnpGWFRuYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poWGIzcFJRbVJJV